<!-- LAYOUT CONTRACT
     SPINE     x=1540..1920
     LEFT_COL  x=660..980
     RIGHT_ISO x=1980..2240 (isolation; below tier_note)
     FAN_OUT   cards x=1960..2220 (EAST of spine; ≥40px gap)
     REGION    x=1480..2260
     SUBAGENTS x=2580..3160
     BLOCKED   x=2580..2940 (bottom)

     BUSES (exclusive; miss every solid vertex AABB):
       x=480  repair → blocked descent
       x=520  awaiting → END
       x=560  explain → END
       x=600  review_fix climb
       x=1080 findings
       x=1140 ticket → scope
       x=1180 repair ↔ verify
       x=2100 isolation → scope (east gutter)
       x=2340 advisory (east of fan-out region)
       x=2440 blocked drain
       y=10   blocked top runway
       y=2000 / 2035 staggered re-verify
       y=3120 repair → blocked bottom

     Fan-out: spine crosses dashed region FILL only; stack+note sit east,
     note BELOW worker (never overlapping). Uniform stack offsets 20/10.
     Subagent children: equal gaps, no spacingTop/Bottom.
     Edge meaning chips are separate cells — not mid-stroke labels.
-->
